      "issues": "https://github.com/GrahamDumpleton/wrapture-workshops/issues"
    },
    {
      "name": "wrap-not-replace",
      "title": "Testing by wrapping, not replacing",
      "description": "Write the same unit tests with unittest.mock and with wrapture, and see what a test can say when the real code keeps running. Strict stubs, calls an object makes to itself, one thing changed, and what did not happen.",
